<title>USA: Kent Electronics Q4 March 31 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Kent Electronics Q4 March 31 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.16		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net			  4,401		    9,540</p>
<p> Revs		     141,172		  119,715</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,857		   27,010</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.00		    $1.21</p>
<p> Net			 27,621		   29,792</p>
<p> Revs		     516,757		  425,810</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,551		   24,696</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Kent Electronics Corp said operating income per share was $0.28 for the fourth quarter of 1997 and $1.12 for the 1997 fiscal year.  Operating income per share was calculated before the effects of a one-time merger and integration cost of $5,500,000 related to the January 1997 acquisitions of Futronix and Wire &amp; Cable Specialties.</p>
